    <ul>
      <li>The calculator and content are provided for general information and estimates only.</li>
      <li>We do not guarantee that results match your actual paycheck, tax bill or refund.</li>
      <li>You are responsible for decisions you make using the results.</li>
      <li>We may change or remove content at any time.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>See also the <a href="/disclaimer/">disclaimer</a> and <a href="/privacy/">privacy policy</a>.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
